# The engineering journals: French, dated, raw. They are the project's memory and a hundred code
# comments name them, so they are not deleted -- but a public repository's history is not the place
# for them, so they live here and stay off the published tree. docs/history/README.md says what
# each one is.
docs/history/

# ---- Recorded benchmark runs (bench/compare.sh --record) ----
bench/.runs/
bench/.ab/
